{"id":"gigante","lemma":"gigante","pos":"noun","rank":1481,"glosses":["giant (mythical human)","giant (a very tall person)","giant (one of the Gigantes of Greek mythology)"],"ipa":"/ʒiˈɡɐ̃.tɨ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"gigantes","feminine":"giganta","femininePlural":"gigantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-gigante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Com quem você estava na roda-gigante?","en":"Who were you with on the Ferris wheel?","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"wheel"},null]},{"text":"Um monstro gigante vem descendo a montanha.","en":"A huge monster is coming down the mountain.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"a fictional creature…"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},{"g":"to descend, to go down","l":"descer"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"mountain"}]},{"text":"Eles pareciam monstros gigantes.","en":"They looked like giant monsters.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a fictional creature…","l":"monstro"},null]},{"text":"A roda-gigante é a minha favorita.","en":"The Ferris wheel is my favorite.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"wheel"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"favourite","l":"favorito"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"the missus"]]},{"text":"Pandas gigantes vivem na China.","en":"Giant pandas live only in China.","words":[{"g":"panda","l":"panda"},null,{"g":"to live","l":"viver"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"a woman"}]}]}